  - m_Id: 2841235128320
    m_Localized: 'Four animals lived in a building in To Kwa Wan.

      On the first
      floor lived an elephant named Bos.

      On the second floor lived a giraffe
      named Isbert.

      On the third floor lived a hedgehog named Jimmie.

      On
      the fourth floor lived a penguin named Orange. Their homes were not large,

'
